(7742005, 1276854, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought this may have been yours, but was not sure. I gave it a 5. The light looks rather flat, as if it were lit straight on from the camera direction. Something from the side may have brought out some of the nice details in those bottles and flowers. Your problem with the colors was definitely fixed with the white balance change to auto. That is looking much better.</td>', 'I thought this may have been yours, but was not sure. I gave it a 5. The light looks rather flat, as if it were lit straight on from the camera direction. Something from the side may have brought out some of the nice details in those bottles and flowers. Your problem with the colors was definitely fixed with the white balance change to auto. That is looking much better.', '2023-04-12 02:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
